t(32, 1515, """The death of displaying bedrooms for the sake of earning""")

t(32, 2530, """The death of trivial, easy jobs""")

t(34, 515, """The future of construction .. The 3D printer is a revolution that man has reached; it does not require internet to work""")

t(34, 1570, """The residential neighbourhoods outside the centre of the city of Jerusalem""")

t(34, 2455, """Many think that development in the Muslim world can be carried out by correcting the mistakes of 1400 years, or 800 years, or 500 years of haphazard building in the great historic cities. This is a deficient understanding, because developing the haphazard consumes very long periods of time, when one speaks of cities of millions in which, for example, 20 million people live, 10 million of them in huge slum districts .. These districts require decades for correction .. Demolition and clearing, then sweeping and cleaning up the remains of the rubble, then digging up old foundations, removing and clearing away their debris, then sweeping and cleaning, then building! Development in the Arab world .. as I conceive it and by induction, is not possible except by moving the residents of the slums to""")

t(35, 150, """entirely new cities built from scratch. This is the only practical solution that can be implemented.""")

t(35, 1225, """When the qat farms burn and become ashes .. and then coffee growing returns, Allah willing, as it was .. then many conditions in our Yemen will be set right, by the power of Allah Almighty""")

t(35, 2270, """May Allah protect our people in Sudan .. the coming food basket of the Arab world""")

t(36, 740, """The key to solving Egypt's great crisis has always been the River Nile .. And because the Egyptians love the Nile, which is their right, for it is a river that no one fails to love .. there is no solution for them for a dignified life except building new cities on the banks of the Nile with new branches .. Even Sinai could have been developed, planted with trees and had its climate changed by extending the Nile to it .. The water wasted into the Mediterranean Sea every day could have done much for dry, desertified Egypt and for the dry, desertified Arabian Peninsula""")

t(36, 1870, """The future of our region will not be told to you by the news bulletins or the breaking-news channels .. The future of our region is known, Allah willing, better than we know our present""")

t(37, 440, """The future of our region is not in the news bulletins""")
